DOCUMENT();

loadMacros(
    "PGstandard.pl",    # Standard macros for PG language
    "PGML.pl",          # PGML markup and Math Objects
    "parserPopUp.pl",
    "PGcourse.pl",      # Customization file for the course
);

# Uncomment the following if you don't want to show which
# answers are correct and which are incorrect
#$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;

$rate = random(1.1,5.5,0.2);

@ans = ();

$ans[0] = sprintf("%0.0f",70/$rate);


BEGIN_PGML
After years of intervention, a certain endangered animal population has an approximate growth rate of about [$rate]% per year. If this is the case, then the doubling time would be approximately [_]{$ans[0]} years (rounded to the nearest whole number).

END_PGML

ENDDOCUMENT();
